      "field": "open_to",
      "quote": "contract research on PCB EMC characterisation and pre-compliance testing; consulting on EMC design review and CISPR compliance strategies; joint projects combining academic simulation with industrial prototype testing; industrial PhD supervision for engineers at electronics companies; student internships involving near-field scanning or PCB signal integrity measurement; equipment access to near-field scanning bench and vector network analyser"
