  "evidenceId": "SYN-PUB-07261",
  "interpretation": "Dijana Radulović (R0637) is an author of SYN-PUB-07261, which describes an automated rule-based layout scoring tool that ingests Gerber files and netlists to extract geometric features related to emission risk and flags violations. This matches the challenge C025-CH1 for predicting and fixing emission hotspots during PCB layout review.",
  "citations": [
    {
      "recordId": "R0637",
